                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ-0pMhzmrQjQRFWSqu3KbmAk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2RHVk1XVEJuTlU1clpXazBWRWM0V1VndFRtYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I stumbled upon this hidden gem on Google Maps! The ambiance was comfortable, the music was just right, and the little dog was adorable (that adorable look in its eyes! (⁎⁍̴̛ᴗ⁍̴̛⁎)). Before coming, I checked the reviews, and many people recommended the omelet and French toast. This time, I ordered the Japanese-style grilled pork omelet, mentaiko and tuna sandwich, apple and cinnamon French toast, zucchini, mushroom, and cheese frittata, wooli black tea, and ruby ​​black tea. Everything was so delicious! I think the French toast deserves the title of best in Songshan District—soft, fluffy, and full of milky flavor, not too sweet, and slightly crispy on the bottom. The omelet was also perfectly executed, capturing the essence of the dish. Even the cherry tomatoes in the tuna sandwich were cooked beautifully. The taste, texture, and seasoning of each dish showed the owner\u0027s dedication. I definitely have to go back!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "在google map上亂晃發現的寶藏店，環境很舒適，音樂很對味，小狗好可愛（那個小眼神(⁎⁍̴̛ᴗ⁍̴̛⁎)\n來之前有先研究留言，很多人推薦粉漿蛋餅與法式吐司，這次點了日式燒肉粉漿蛋餅、明太子鮪魚三明治、蘋果肉桂法式吐司、櫛瓜蘑菇起司烘蛋、wooli紅茶及紅玉紅茶。\n都好好吃欸好誇張，法式吐司私以為能榮登松山區最好吃法式吐司，鬆軟綿密充滿奶香，不會太甜底下還有些微焦脆；粉漿蛋餅那個恰恰的靈魂也很到位，連鮪魚三明治裡面的小番茄都煮的好好吃，每份餐點味道、口感，調味層次都感受到老闆的用心，必須回訪！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Yen-tsu Liu",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106309687699907944724/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWy7yKQXj1z5Ah1AnOQgUS59MyqwwuxibMbDDPHxt07Nk58KAcsAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2026-01-17T02:04:08.518009048Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2RHVk1XVEJuTlU1clpXazBWRWM0V1VndFRtYxAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2RHVk1XVEJuTlU1clpXazBWRWM0V1VndFRtYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab39874c4afb:0x9989b72bbaa6415"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ-0pMhzmrQjQRFWSqu3KbmAk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5SGIydzBUV3RZTXpOaVRFeDBORXhwVm1wb1FVRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Advance reservations via Line are required, but you can also secure a table by sending a message on a weekend morning.\n\nThe dining environment is very comfortable, and the owner has excellent taste. I loved everything from the space and decor to the music! 🤩 The cheese omelet was delicious, with generous portions of ingredients, and very satisfying. The plum Americano was a little weak at first, but the plum flavor gradually came out after about half of it had steeped.\n\nYou can feel the owner\u0027s dedication; they care about customers\u0027 feelings and ask for feedback. They really put their heart into running the business! There are also two adorable dogs that are very affectionate. ❤️",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "需提前用line預約，假日早上臨時傳訊息也能預約到位置。\n用餐環境很舒適，老闆的品味很讚，從空間佈置、擺設到音樂都很喜歡🤩\n起司粉漿蛋餅好吃，用料扎實，吃起來很滿足～ 梅子美式一開始喝味道稍淡，喝到一半左右梅子泡久了味道會慢慢出來。\n能感受到老闆的用心，會關心客人的感受與詢問回饋，很用心在經營！還有兩隻狗狗超可愛，很會撒嬌❤️",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "meng",
